From: CeraLive <dev@ceralive.tv>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 37/37] arm64: dts: rockchip: add the RK3588 MPP JPEG decoder

Add the donor-only JPEG decoder client and its mainline Rockchip IOMMU node.
The compatible is read directly from the imported mpp_jpgdec match table, and
the client skips the unavailable BSP PMU idle-request path.

Origin: rockchip-linux/kernel@b4ef083dc0c3608e744deabb43dc6b781aadbe6e:arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s.dtsi
Reference: armbian/linux-rockchip@fd9f82366e235b8afbdf516765210e97d24dce93:arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s.dtsi

Patches a file mainline already carries. The payload below is carried byte-for-byte from integration/0012-arm64-dts-rk3588-mpp-jpegd-node.patch; scripts/build-series.py adds the mail header and nothing else, and scripts/verify-series-parity.py proves that independently.


